+::  NMEME consensus upgrade candidate. Disabled in the distributable build.
+::  A network-coordinated release must pin one activation height here.
+::  Changing this value changes consensus; it is NOT a user preference.
+|%
+++  phase
+  ^-  (unit @)
+  ~
+++  active
+  |=  [activation=(unit @) height=@]
+  ^-  ?
+  ?~  activation  %.n
+  (gte height u.activation)
+++  creditable
+  |=  [activation=(unit @) height=@ origin=@]
+  ^-  ?
+  ?~  activation  %.n
+  ?&  (gte height u.activation)
+      (gte origin u.activation)
+      (lte origin height)
+  ==
+--
